### endpoints de los bloques ###

### Registrar un bloque ###
POST http://localhost:8080/block HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "blockCode": "130-1110",
    "name": "1110"
}

### recuperar todos los bloques
GET http://localhost:8080/block HTTP/1.1

### recuperar un bloque por su id
GET http://localhost:8080/block/130-1110 HTTP/1.1

### actualizar un bloque por su id
PUT http://localhost:8080/block/130-1110 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "2360"
}

### borra un bloque por su id
DELETE http://localhost:8080/block/130-1110 HTTP/1.1